        "operationId": "ResolveSecrets",
        "summary": "Resolve secrets",
        "description": "The environment a session gets as it starts: each variable granted to its agent, its role, one of its host's labels, or all, set to its secret's current value. Of two grants for one variable, the more specific wins: agent, then role, then label, then all; of two labels' grants, the older. Recorded in the audit with the variables' names, never their values. Resolver tokens only (`keyring token create <name> --resolver`).",
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Whom the session is for.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
